From 50cc79a19e07041ec0e994427ef8d2429bed0297 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 20:22:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] shared: stub the two remaining amas_lib.o TrendMicro mesh
 symbols

get_fw_mesh_extender / mesh_set_extender (TrendMicro.h, provided by the
dropped -lbwdpi) are also referenced by the closed amas_lib.o from
amaslib_get_RE_mode. Full nm audit of amas_lib.o + nt_mail.o against the
libshared/rc/json-c/libc provider pool confirms these are the LAST two
unresolved symbols with the DPI engine compiled out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/shared/bwdpi_utils.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/release/src/router/shared/bwdpi_utils.c b/release/src/router/shared/bwdpi_utils.c
index 1cc71b0eff..93ddbc287b 100644
--- a/release/src/router/shared/bwdpi_utils.c
+++ b/release/src/router/shared/bwdpi_utils.c
@@ -246,6 +246,20 @@ int get_fw_user_list(void *output, unsigned int *used_len)
 	(void)used_len;
 	return -1;
 }
+
+int get_fw_mesh_extender(void **output, unsigned int *buf_used_len)
+{
+	(void)output;
+	(void)buf_used_len;
+	return -1;
+}
+
+int mesh_set_extender(char *macstr, unsigned char action)
+{
+	(void)macstr;
+	(void)action;
+	return -1;
+}
 #endif
 
